t, sovereign, and individual clients to various industry areas, including consumers and retail; financial institutions; financial sponsors; healthcare and life sciences; industrials; media, entertainment, and sports; power, energy, and infrastructure; real estate; technology; and telecom and digital infrastructure. The Asset Management segment offers a range of investment solutions; investment and wealth management services in equity and fixed income strategies; asset allocation strategies; and alternative investments and private equity funds to corporations, public funds, sovereign entities, endowments and foundations, labor funds, financial intermediaries, and private clients. Lazard, Inc. was incorporated in 1848 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"6282","sic_desc":"Investment Advice","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","mcap":3515042304,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"NEW YORK, NY","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1311370,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-06-30","rev":662318000.0,"rev_yoy":0.3,"eps":-1.41,"eps_yoy":-253.3,"ni":-124013000.0,"ni_yoy":-229.9,"nm":-18.7,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":543170000.0,"rev_yoy":-27.2,"eps":0.06,"eps_yoy":-94.3,"ni":7139000.0,"ni_yoy":-93.3,"nm":1.3,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":825763000.0,"rev_yoy":12.8,"eps":0.7,"eps_yoy":45.8,"ni":64046000.0,"ni_yoy":49.5,"nm":7.8,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":785481000.0,"rev_yoy":39.8,"eps":0.35,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":35755000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":4.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":707991000.0,"rev_yoy":6.9,"eps":0.49,"eps_yoy":"turne